  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>In oxoacids phosphorus is tetrahedrally surrounded by other atoms.<br />All these acids contain at least one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> bond and one <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>OH</mi></math> bond.</p><p>Pyrophosphorous acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>Hypophosphoric acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>Phosphoric acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>Pyrophosphoric acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math>.</p></blockquote>",
